  "id": "ham-and-cheese-frittata",
  "name": "Ham and Cheese Frittata",
  "subtitle": "A skillet frittata with tender potatoes, ham, and cheddar",
  "description": "Cook the vegetables until tender, add the egg mixture and ham, then finish under the grill with cheddar until fully set.",
